    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/ba/Yumi_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240904183927\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Yumi Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"960\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Yumi Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Yumi_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/b/ba/Yumi_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240904183927\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>黑影的继承者</b>\n\nYumi(雪泉)是《闪乱神乐》系列中的可玩角色，在《闪乱神乐：少女的选择》中首次登场。\n\n</p><p>她是精英女忍者学院「月闪女子学园」的三年级学生兼领袖。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">外观</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYumi%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Yumi身材高挑，皮肤白皙，淡蓝色眼睛，中深灰色头发，整体气质平平。她常用一条宽大的白色缎带装饰头发，末端带有蓝色条纹。\n\n</p><p>穿着忍者服装时，她穿着一件白色振袖和服，衣领从肩膀滑落，露出一大片胸部。这套服装有蓝色双线镶边，背后有一条蓝色腰带。Yumi还穿着白袜子，但不穿鞋，或者自《Estival Versus》起穿淡紫色人字拖。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">性格</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYumi%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Yumi被描述为一个冷静而认真的女孩，自《Shinovi Versus》起就因坚持目标和理想而被认为固执。虽然她理应承担杰森精英队队长的责任，但她可能很容易被骗，例如Shiki可以让他们在为《Shinovi Masters》锦标赛做准备时做无用的健身练习。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">画廊</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FYumi%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px